        <div class="section" id="section-1">
            <h2>1. 内容总览</h2>

            <h3>核心观点总结</h3>
            <p>这个vlog记录了一位数字游民在泰国清迈独自生活一个月的经历。视频创作者分享了他们因心理健康原因休假3个月后重返工作的经历，以及工作中感受到的疲惫感。这个视频探讨了独自旅行、数字游民生活方式、心理健康和工作与生活平衡等主题。</p>

            <h3>关键词列表</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>英文</th>
                        <th>中文</th>
                        <th>语境提示</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td><strong>Digital Nomad</strong></td><td>数字游民</td><td>远程工作+旅行生活方式</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Chiang Mai</strong></td><td>清迈</td><td>泰国北部城市</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Leave of absence</strong></td><td>休假</td><td>暂时离开工作</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Mental health</strong></td><td>心理健康</td><td>心理状态和福祉</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Draining</strong></td><td>消耗精力的</td><td>使人疲惫的</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Solo travel</strong></td><td>独自旅行</td><td>单人旅行</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Work-life balance</strong></td><td>工作生活平衡</td><td>平衡工作和生活</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Burnout</strong></td><td>职业倦怠</td><td>过度工作导致的疲惫</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Afford</strong></td><td>负担得起</td><td>有经济能力</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Remote work</strong></td><td>远程工作</td><td>在外地工作</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Vlog</strong></td><td>视频博客</td><td>视频日记</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Experience</strong></td><td>经历/体验</td><td>亲身经历的事情</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Lifestyle</strong></td><td>生活方式</td><td>生活的方式</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Community</strong></td><td>社区/社群</td><td>一群有共同兴趣的人</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section" id="section-2">
            <h2>2. 核心词汇表（20个）</h2>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>1. <strong>Digital Nomad</strong> <code>/ˈdɪdʒɪtl ˈnoʊmæd/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>数字游民</strong></p>

                <p><strong>📖 语境含义</strong><br>利用互联网远程工作、同时在不同地方旅行生活的人</p>

                <p><strong>💬 材料中的原句用法</strong></p>
                <blockquote>"Living in Thailand as a <strong>digital nomad</strong> has become a popular lifestyle choice for many remote workers."</blockquote>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💼 职场场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Many tech companies now hire <strong>digital nomads</strong> who work remotely from around the world."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>☕ 日常场景</strong><br><blockquote>"My friend became a <strong>digital nomad</strong> last year and has traveled to 12 countries since then."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>📚 学术场景</strong><br><blockquote>"The rise of <strong>digital nomadism</strong> has changed traditional concepts of work and location."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>become a digital nomad - 成为数字游民</li>
                    <li>digital nomad lifestyle - 数字游民生活方式</li>
                    <li>digital nomad community - 数字游民社群</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>2. <strong>Leave of absence</strong> <code>/liːv əv ˈæbsəns/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>休假</strong></p>

                <p><strong>📖 语境含义</strong><br>暂时离开工作或学习的正式许可</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💼 职场场景</strong><br><blockquote>"She had to take a <strong>leave of absence</strong> due to health issues."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>☕ 日常场景</strong><br><blockquote>"After working for five years without a break, he decided to request a <strong>leave of absence</strong>."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>🎓 学术场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Students can apply for a <strong>leave of absence</strong> for personal or medical reasons."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>take a leave of absence - 请假</li>
                    <li>on a leave of absence - 在休假中</li>
                    <li>request/ask for a leave of absence - 申请休假</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>3. <strong>Draining</strong> <code>/ˈdreɪnɪŋ/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>消耗精力的</strong></p>

                <p><strong>📖 语境含义</strong><br>使某人感到非常疲惫或精神耗尽</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💼 职场场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Dealing with difficult customers all day can be absolutely <strong>draining</strong>."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>☕ 日常场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Socializing with too many people at once is <strong>draining</strong> for introverts."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>📚 学习场景</strong><br><blockquote>"The intense exam period was mentally <strong>draining</strong> for students."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>emotionally draining - 情感上消耗的</li>
                    <li>mentally draining - 精神上消耗的</li>
                    <li>absolutely draining - 绝对消耗的</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>4. <strong>Mental Health</strong> <code>/ˈmentl ˈhelθ/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>心理健康</strong></p>

                <p><strong>📖 语境含义</strong><br>一个人的心理、情感和社交福祉状态</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💼 职场场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Companies are increasingly recognizing the importance of employee <strong>mental health</strong>."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>☕ 日常场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Taking breaks and exercising regularly are good for your <strong>mental health</strong>."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>📚 学术场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Recent studies have shown a correlation between stress and <strong>mental health</strong> issues."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>mental health issues/problems - 心理健康问题</li>
                    <li>affect mental health - 影响心理健康</li>
                    <li>prioritize mental health - 优先考虑心理健康</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>5. <strong>Solo</strong> <code>/ˈsoʊloʊ/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>单独的，独自的</strong></p>

                <p><strong>📖 语境含义</strong><br>独自完成某事，没有他人陪伴</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>✈️ 旅行场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Traveling <strong>solo</strong> can be both challenging and rewarding."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>💼 工作场景</strong><br><blockquote>"She decided to go <strong>solo</strong> and start her own business."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>☕ 日常场景</strong><br><blockquote>"I prefer a <strong>solo</strong> trip to reflect on myself."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>solo travel - 独自旅行</li>
                    <li>go solo - 单干/单独行动</li>
                    <li>solo adventure - 独自冒险</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>6. <strong>Afford</strong> <code>/əˈfɔːrd/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>负担得起</strong></p>

                <p><strong>📖 语境含义</strong><br>有足够的经济能力、时间或资源去做某事</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💰 财务场景</strong><br><blockquote>"I can't <strong>afford</strong> to buy a new car right now."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>⏰ 时间场景</strong><br><blockquote>"We can't <strong>afford</strong> to waste any more time on this project."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>🎯 抽象场景</strong><br><blockquote>"You can't <strong>afford</strong> to lose this opportunity."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>7. <strong>Remote</strong> <code>/rɪˈmoʊt/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>远程的，遥远的</strong></p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💼 工作场景</strong><br><blockquote>"More companies are offering <strong>remote</strong> work options after the pandemic."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>📍 地理位置</strong><br><blockquote>"They live in a <strong>remote</strong> village in the mountains."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>💻 技术场景</strong><br><blockquote>"<strong>Remote</strong> collaboration tools have become essential for modern businesses."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>remote work - 远程工作</li>
                    <li>remote location - 偏远地点</li>
                    <li>work remotely - 远程工作</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>8. <strong>Burnout</strong> <code>/ˈbɜːrnaʊt/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>职业倦怠</strong></p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💼 工作场景</strong><br><blockquote>"The doctor warned me about <strong>burnout</strong> from working too many hours."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>☕ 生活场景</strong><br><blockquote>"She quit her job due to <strong>burnout</strong> and stress."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>🛡️ 预防场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Taking regular breaks can help prevent <strong>burnout</strong>."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>suffer from burnout - 遭受职业倦怠</li>
                    <li>experience burnout - 经历职业倦怠</li>
                    <li>prevent burnout - 预防职业倦怠</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>9. <strong>Community</strong> <code>/kəˈmjuːnəti/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>社区，社群</strong></p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>💻 数字游民场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Chiang Mai has a large <strong>digital nomad community</strong>."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>🏘️ 本地场景</strong><br><blockquote>"The <strong>local community</strong> organizes events every month."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>🌐 在线场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Online <strong>communities</strong> help people connect with others."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>digital nomad community - 数字游民社群</li>
                    <li>local community - 当地社区</li>
                    <li>online community - 在线社群</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>10. <strong>Experience</strong> <code>/ɪkˈspɪriəns/</code></h3>
                <p><strong>经历，体验</strong></p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>✈️ 旅行场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Living in Thailand was an unforgettable <strong>experience</strong>."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>💼 工作场景</strong><br><blockquote>"She has five years of <strong>experience</strong> in marketing."</blockquote></li>
                    <li><strong>📚 学习场景</strong><br><blockquote>"Hands-on <strong>experience</strong> is the best way to learn."</blockquote></li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>🔗 习惯搭配</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>gain experience - 获得经验</li>
                    <li>have experience - 有经验</li>
                    <li>unforgettable experience - 难忘的经历</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section" id="section-3">
            <h2>3. 地道表达（15个）</h2>

            <div class="expression-card">
                <h3>1. <strong>Take time off</strong> - 休假</h3>

                <p><strong>📖 释义</strong>：暂时停止工作或学习</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ol>
                    <li>"I need to <strong>take some time off</strong> to recharge."</li>
                    <li>"She <strong>took time off</strong> to travel."</li>
                    <li>"After the project ends, I'm planning to <strong>take a month off</strong>."</li>
                </ol>

                <p><strong>💡 同义表达</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>take a break - 休息</li>
                    <li>go on leave - 休假</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="expression-card">
                <h3>2. <strong>Hit the road</strong> - 上路，出发</h3>

                <p><strong>📖 释义</strong>：开始旅程</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ol>
                    <li>"We need to <strong>hit the road</strong> early tomorrow morning."</li>
                    <li>"After months of planning, they finally <strong>hit the road</strong>."</li>
                    <li>"<strong>Hit the road</strong> and enjoy the adventure!"</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <div class="expression-card">
                <h3>3. <strong>Find oneself</strong> - 发现自我</h3>

                <p><strong>📖 释义</strong>：通过经历来了解真实的自己</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ol>
                    <li>"Traveling solo helped her <strong>find herself</strong>."</li>
                    <li>"After years of working in corporate, he took time off to <strong>find himself</strong>."</li>
                    <li>"Sometimes you need to step away from your routine to <strong>find yourself</strong>."</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <div class="expression-card">
                <h3>4. <strong>On a budget</strong> - 预算有限</h3>

                <p><strong>📖 释义</strong>：只有有限的钱可用</p>

                <p><strong>✍️ 实用例句</strong></p>
                <ol>
                    <li>"Chiang Mai is perfect for digital nomads <strong>on a budget</strong>."</li>
                    <li>"We traveled through Southeast Asia <strong>on a tight budget</strong>."</li>
                    <li>"Living <strong>on a budget</strong> requires careful planning."</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section" id="section-4">
            <h2>4. 句型解析（8个）</h2>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>1. 主语 + 动词 + 宾语 + 补语</h3>

                <p><strong>📝 示例结构</strong></p>
                <blockquote>"I find living alone <strong>challenging but rewarding</strong>."</blockquote>

                <p><strong>🔍 句型分析</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>主语：I</li>
                    <li>动词：find</li>
                    <li>宾语：living alone</li>
                    <li>宾语补足语：challenging but rewarding</li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>✍️ 替换练习模板</strong></p>
                <ol>
                    <li>She finds working remotely <strong>liberating but lonely</strong>.</li>
                    <li>They find the digital nomad lifestyle <strong>exciting but uncertain</strong>.</li>
                    <li>We find solo travel <strong>empowering but sometimes difficult</strong>.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <div class="word-card">
                <h3>2. Not only... but also... - 不仅...而且...</h3>

                <p><strong>📝 示例结构</strong></p>
                <blockquote>"Solo travel is <strong>not only</strong> challenging, <strong>but also</strong> incredibly rewarding."</blockquote>

                <p><strong>✍️ 替换练习模板</strong></p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Chiang Mai is <strong>not only</strong> affordable, <strong>but also</strong> culturally rich.</li>
                    <li>Remote work offers <strong>not only</strong> flexibility, <strong>but also</strong> freedom.</li>
                    <li>This journey was <strong>not only</strong> an adventure, <strong>but also</strong> a learning experience.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section" id="section-5">
            <h2>5. 学习任务</h2>

            <h3>📖 阅读理解题（5道）</h3>

            <div class="practice-section">
                <h4>题目 1：细节理解</h4>
                <p>According to the video, why did the creator return to their job after a 3-month leave?</p>
                <ol type="A">
                    <li>They missed their coworkers</li>
                    <li>They couldn't afford to quit</li>
                    <li>Their job required them to return</li>
                    <li>They were bored of traveling</li>
                </ol>

                <p><strong>✅ 正确答案：B</strong></p>
                <p><strong>💡 解析</strong>：视频提到创作者的工作"absolutely draining"（非常消耗精力）但他们"can't afford to quit"（负担不起辞职）。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="practice-section">
                <h4>题目 2：推理判断</h4>
                <p>What can be inferred about the creator's attitude toward their job?</p>
                <ol type="A">
                    <li>They love their job deeply</li>
                    <li>They find their job fulfilling</li>
                    <li>Their job negatively impacts their mental health</li>
                    <li>They plan to quit soon</li>
                </ol>

                <p><strong>✅ 正确答案：C</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="practice-section">
                <h4>题目 3：主旨大意</h4>
                <p>What is the main theme of this video?</p>
                <ol type="A">
                    <li>How to become a digital nomad</li>
                    <li>A personal journey of solo travel and mental health</li>
                    <li>A travel guide to Chiang Mai</li>
                    <li>Tips for remote work</li>
                </ol>

                <p><strong>✅ 正确答案：B</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="practice-section">
                <h4>题目 4：词义猜测</h4>
                <p>In the context "the job is absolutely draining," what does "draining" mean?</p>
                <ol type="A">
                    <li>Financially costly</li>
                    <li>Physically and emotionally exhausting</li>
                    <li>Time-consuming</li>
                    <li>Boring</li>
                </ol>

                <p><strong>✅ 正确答案：B</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="practice-section">
                <h4>题目 5：细节理解</h4>
                <p>Where did the creator spend their month alone?</p>
                <ol type="A">
                    <li>Bangkok, Thailand</li>
                    <li>Phuket, Thailand</li>
                    <li>Chiang Mai, Thailand</li>
                    <li>Pai, Thailand</li>
                </ol>

                <p><strong>✅ 正确答案：C</strong></p>
            </div>

            <h3>✍️ 口语/写作练习题（4个）</h3>

            <div class="practice-section">
                <h4>练习 1：观点讨论</h4>
